SUMMARY:Celebrate 60 - Star Trek Fan Event @ BSFFF
DESCRIPTION:The Sci Fi Book Club\nHi everybody!\n\n[Brooklyn SciFi Film Fe
 stival](https://brooklynscififilmfest.com/)\, NYC Star Trek MeetUp\, and S
 t. Mark's Comics present a family-friendly program of six Star Trek-inspir
 ed fan films with Trek-themed entertainment hosted at bkOne’s Tom Kane T
 heater in Industry City\, Sunset Park\, Brooklyn on Saturday\, October 10t
 h\, from 1pm to 4pm. With special musical performances\, films\, and life-
 size Star Trek character pop-ups for photos. St. Mark’s Comics joins the
  event\, showcasing comics and collectibles.\n\n**[Purchase your tickets f
 or this event via Eventbrite](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/star-trek-fan-f
 ilm-event-brooklyn-scifi-film-festival-tickets-2000514915966?aff=ebdsshcop
 yurl&utm-campaign=social&utm-content=attendeeshare&utm-medium=discovery&ut
 m-term=creator-collections&utm-share-source=creator-collections )\, your r
 svp to this Meetup event is not enough.** Get your tickets asap if you're 
 interested\, this event will sell out!\n\n**Use the code SIFIBookClubBSF26
  for 15% off.**\n\nThe festival has highlighted hundreds of bold voices in
  the genre\, and we're back for our seventh annual program\, showcasing mo
 re than 200 films from around the world. BSFFF will run October 5–18\, 2
 026\, streaming online and at in-person events the 5th-11th across Brookly
 n.\n\nHope to see you there!\nCheers\,\nJon & Meghan
