SUMMARY:Open Signal: The Sci Fi Book Club
DESCRIPTION:The Sci Fi Book Club\nYou asked\, we listened! We're back for 
 another **monthly casual Zoom hangout** to chat about what you're watching
 \, listening to\, reading\, and doing for fun. We're calling it *Open Sign
 al*\, so bring your thoughts\, interesting articles\, and any other sci fi
 -related news or discoveries you'd like to share. Our next installment wil
 l be Thursday\, November 12th at 7pm ET.\n\nOne of the best things about t
 his community is the wide range of interests and experiences you all bring
  to our meetings. We can't wait to catch up with y'all and get some fresh 
 media recommendations. As a reminder\, no political discussion and everyon
 e is welcome.\n\nThis is not a Book of the Month meeting\, more a chance t
 o get together and chat about everything else. ***Book of the Month meetin
 gs will continue to be held on Zoom on the third Sunday of each month.***\
 n\nCheers\,\nJon & Meghan
